160/witness/k7_N76_from_scottschluer.txt is the 7-colouring of {1, ..., 76} published in
github.com/scottschluer/erdos160 (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.23473523); credit for it belongs to its author. It is kept
here because the search for the 77-colouring started from it.

1159/planes/hall9.txt, dhall9.txt and hughes9.txt are the Hall, dual Hall and Hughes planes of order 9 as listed by
G. Eric Moorhouse (ericmoorhouse.org, projective planes of small order); credit for them belongs to him. They are kept
here, unchanged, so that the checks can run without a download (1159/controls/red_hughes9_points_swapped.txt is a
deliberately damaged copy of hughes9.txt, used as a red control).

The programs in */src/, */checks/, */controls/ and checks/, and the Lean file in 160/lean/, are licensed under the
MIT License (LICENSE-CODE).
